## Proposed Changes

### Core Gameplay & Sync (`app.js`)

#### [MODIFY] [app.js](file:///c:/Users/Administrator/Downloads/digiversity-copilot-main/app.js)
- **Host Broadcast Engine**: Modify `executeQuestionBroadcast` to atomically clear `answers` and `reactions` nodes in Firebase.
- **Player State Tracking**:
  - Add `playerActiveQuestionIndex` to global state.
  - In `preparePlayerInputInterface(session)`, check if the question index is new. If so, reset `hasAnsweredCurrent` and update `playerActiveQuestionIndex`.
- **Session Auto-Recovery**:
  - Save session parameters to `sessionStorage` upon joining.
  - On page load, check `sessionStorage` for active session parameters and auto-rejoin if present.
  - Provide a `terminatePlayerSession` helper to clear `sessionStorage` when the game ends or player leaves.
- **Manual Sync**: Add handler for `btn-player-sync` to manually run `bindPlayerSessionSyncPipeline`.

